__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
artifacts/anomaly-lab/

# Generated enterprise simulation. The USB image, Wazuh configuration, returned
# audit and experiment reports ARE committed, so everyone shares one release set
# and verifies against identical bytes. See docs/enterprise-sim-handoff.md.
#
# The contextual training datasets are ~21 MB and regenerate deterministically
# from seed 1729, so they stay out of the repository:
artifacts/enterprise-sim/datasets/
#
# Never commit a signing key, even a demonstration one. Only the public
# verifying key belongs here.
artifacts/enterprise-sim/keys/*.sk
